## Model Status

| Component | Status | Notes |
|-----------|--------|-------|
| GPR surrogate | ⚠️ WEAK | Trained on 5 samples — predictions are flat ~7.6×10⁻⁴ |
| Random Forest screener | ⚠️ WEAK | Same 5-sample issue |
| CHGNet relaxation | ✅ WORKS | Physically accurate structure relaxation |
| CHGNet MD | ✅ WORKS | 1 ns trajectories → real Arrhenius |
| M3GNet cross-check | ✅ WORKS (if matgl installed) | Independent energy validation |
| Dynamical stability | ⚠️ PARTIAL | Returns inf (phonopy convergence issue) |
| Mechanical stability | ✅ FIXED | Syntax error resolved, mock tensor in place |
| Thermodynamic hull | ⚠️ NEEDS KEY | Requires MP_API_KEY env var |

**Root cause of weak model**: `fast_surrogate_extraction.py` has `df.head(5)` — only 5 of 154 experimental samples are used for training. **Remove this line before running.**

